 "policy_section": {
  "ref": "Product catalogue §2",
  "text": "Product catalogue §2 Soundbox\n\n**Who it suits.** Busy counters where the owner cannot check the phone for every payment: kiranas, chai stalls, food stalls, pharmacies.\n\n**Readiness signals.** Steady UPI volume (§1.2), QR only, disputes or tickets about \"payment not received\", peak-hour crowds.\n\n**What it costs.** Monthly rental of ₹99–199 (illus.), deducted from the first settlement of the month and shown in the deductions list.\n\n**What not to promise.** It does not reduce fees, raise sales by itself or affect loan eligibility. Do not say \"free\" if a rental applies.\n\n---"
 }
